[0.402, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/history/architecture-notes.md:565\u001b[39m). Every material fills all 8 slots, using white, black or flat-normal\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bstand-ins for the one\u001b[25G it\u001b[29Gleaves empty, so the set is\u001b[57Galways complet\u001b[74G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mRaising it to 16.\u001b[21G\u001b[22mIt'\u001b[25G mostly a\u001b[35Gone-constant change. The\u001b[60Glayout, the descriptor\u001b[83Gpool, the descriptor writes, the\u001b[116Gcache\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Barrays and the refusal test all follow \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mkMaterialTextureSlots\u001b[39m. The programs' GLSL de\u001b[87Glares its own set-1 b\u001b[110Gdings,\u001b[117Gso\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcheck thos\u001b[14G, but most\u001b[25Gneed\u001b[30Gno\u001b[33Gedit.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTrade-offs:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BDevice limi\u001b[15Gs\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mCost:\u001b[22m The fragment stage already uses 5 samplers\u001b[52Gfrom\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gframe\u001b[67Gset\u001b[71G(bindings\u001b[81G4,\u001b[84G5,\u001b[87G6,\u001b[90G10,\u001b[94G16).\u001b[99GWith\u001b[104G8\u001b[106Gmaterial\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  slo\u001b[11Gthat's\u001b[18G13,\u001b[22Ginside\u001b[29GVulkan's\u001b[38Gguaranteed\u001b[49Gminimum\u001b[57Gof\u001b[60G16\u001b[63Gper\u001b[67Gstage.\u001b[74GWith\u001b[79G16\u001b[82Gslots\u001b[88Git's\u001b[93G21,\u001b[97Gwhich\u001b[103Ggoes\u001b[108Gpast\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  guarantee. NVIDIA, AMD \u001b[29Gnd\u001b[32Glavapipe \u001b[42Gll\u001b[45Gallow far\u001b[55Gmore, \u001b[62Go it works on\u001b[76Gevery m\u001b[84Gchine\u001b[90Gyou\u001b[94Gtarget.\u001b[102GBut\u001b[106Gyou'd\u001b[112Gbe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  relying on what those drivers report, not\u001b[47Gon\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54Gspec,\u001b[60Gso\u001b[63Gadd\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Gstartup\u001b[77Gcheck\