to read. J64\u001b[88Galready moves vertex data to\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfetch\u001b[9Gby-address, so bindless textur\u001b[40Gs would\u001b[48Gfit\u001b[52Gthe s\u001b[58Gme dir\u001b[65Gction.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMy recommendation:\u001b[22G\u001b[22mif\u001b[25Ga\u001b[27Greal\u001b[32Gmaterial\u001b[41Gneeds\u001b[47Gmore\u001b[52Gthan\u001b[57G8\u001b[59Gnow,\u001b[64Gbump\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Gconstant\u001b[82Gto\u001b[85G16\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92Gadd\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Glimit\u001b[106Gcheck.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOtherwise, put bindless\u001b[27Gon the roadmap n\u001b[44Gxt\u001b[47Gt\u001b[49G J40 \u001b[56Gd J47 and don't spe\u001b[76Gd effort\u001b[85Gon\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gslot count.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gdidn't\u001b[12Gcheck\u001b[18Ghow\u001b[22Gmany\u001b[27Gtextures\u001b[36Gtoday's\u001b[44Gprograms\u001b[53Gactually\u001b[62Guse,\u001b[67Gdidn't\u001b[74Gbuild\u001b[80Ganything,\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gdidn't\u001b[101Gread\u001b[106Gthe\u001b[110Glimits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvulkaninfo\u001b[39m reports\u001b[22Gon \u001b[26Gour GPUs.\u001b[36G       \u001b[44G   \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
