[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G- The\u001b[9Gper-material limit goes \u001b[34Gway\u001b[38Gentirely.\u001b[48G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe\u001b[9Gone-descriptor-pool-per-material\u001b[42Gpattern\u001b[50Gin\u001b[53G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mMaterialCache::AllocateSet\u001b[80G\u001b[39mgoes\u001b[85Gaway\u001b[90Gtoo.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- The planned mesh-shader path (J40) and ray-traced hit shading (J47) become much easier. Per-material descriptor sets\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  are awkward for both, and ray-traced hit\u001b[46Gshading\u001b[54Geffective\u001b[64Gy needs\u001b[72Gbindless.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe cost is a b\u001b[19Ggger chan\u001b[29Ge. Shaders hav\u001b[44G to\u001b[48Gmark\u001b[53Gtexture\u001b[61Gindices\u001b[69Gwith\u001b[74G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnonuniformEXT\u001b[88G\u001b[39mwhere\u001b[94Gthey\u001b[99Gvary\u001b[104Gacross\u001b[111Ga\u001b[113Gdraw.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BStand-i\u001b[11Gs b\u001b[15Gcome fixed indices in the array, and validation gets harder to read. J64 already\u001b[96Gmoves\u001b[102Gvertex\u001b[109Gdata\u001b[114Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfetch-by-address, so bindless textures would fit the same direction.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMy recommendation:\u001b[22G\u001b[22mif\u001b[25Ga\u001b[27Greal\u001b[32Gmaterial\u001b[41Gneeds\u001b[47Gmore\u001b[52Gthan\u001b[57G8\u001b[59Gnow,\u001b[64Gbump\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Gconstant\u001b[82Gto\u001b[85G16\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92Gadd\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Glimit\u001b[106Gcheck.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOtherwise, put bindless on the roadmap n\u001b[44Gx\u001b[46G to J40 and J47 and don't spend effort on\u001b[88Gt\u001b[91G slot count.\u001b[104G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI didn't check how many textures \u001b[37Goday's programs actu\u001b[58Glly us\u001b[65G, didn't\u001b[74Gbuild\u001b[80Ganything,\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gdidn't\u001b[101Gread\u001b[106Gthe\u001b[110Glimits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvulkaninfo\u001b[14G\u001b[39mreports\u001b[22Gon\u001b[25Gyour\u001b[30GGPUs.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GSautéed for 45s · done 5:15 pm\u001b[34G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255madd bindless textures to the roadmap\u001b[39m                                                                                  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[3GOrbiting… \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip:\u001b[11GUse\u001b[15G/memory to\u001b[26Gview\u001b[31Gand manage Claude memory\r\u001b[3B❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
