[0.002, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI've added bindless textures to the roadmap as \u001b[1mJ68\u001b[22m. I put it in the dense-geometry and ray-tracing track because\u001b[116GJ42\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Balready planned a \"bindless material table\" for ray-traced hits, so J42 now reads its materials through J68's texture\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Barray instead of building its own.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mdocs/roadmap.md\u001b[22m\u001b[39m: \u001b[23G n\u001b[26Gw J68 row\u001b[36Gin\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gtrack's\u001b[51Gtable,\u001b[58Gwhich\u001b[64Gneeds\u001b[70Gnothing.\u001b[79GJ42's\u001b[85Grow\u001b[89Gnow\u001b[93Glists\u001b[99GJ68\u001b[103Gamong\u001b[109Gwhat\u001b[114Git\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bneeds,\u001b[12Gand\u001b[16Gthe\u001b[20Gtrack's\u001b[28GID\u001b[31Grange\u001b[37Gnow\u001b[41Gincludes\u001b[50GJ68.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mdocs/dense-geometry-and-ray-tracing.md\u001b[22m\u001b[39m:\u001b[45Ga J68 stage section\u001b[65Gwith what it d\u001b[80Glivers and how\u001b[95Git\u001b[98Gcounts as done,\u001b[114Ga\u001b[116Grow\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bin\u001b[8Gthe\u001b[12Gstages\u001b[19Gtable\u001b[25G(1\u001b[28Gto\u001b[31G2\u001b[33Gweeks),\u001b[41Gand\u001b[45Ga\u001b[47GJ68\u001b[51G→\u001b[53GJ42\u001b[57Garrow\u001b[63Gin\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gdependency\u001b[81Ggraph.\u001b[88GJ42's\u001b[94Gsection\u001b[102Gand\u001b[106Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  device-capabilities table were updated to match.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GWhat\u001b[8GJ68 \u001b[13Gel\u001b[16Gvers: ev\u001b[25Gry material texture goe\u001b[50Gin one\u001b[57Gdescriptor array, and th\u001b[82G material buffer holds each slot's\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bind\u001b[7Gx into it. The f\u001b[24Gxed \u001b[29Get of 8 s\u001b[39Go\u001b[41Gs and\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gone\u001b[55Gpool-per-material setup\u001b[79Ggo away, and the slo\u001b[100G c\u001b[104Gnt\u001b[107Gbecomes a\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnamed\u001b[9Gconst\u001b[15Gnt instea\u001b[25G of\u001b[29Ga pr\u001b[34Gperty\u001b[40Gof\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gdescriptor\u001b[58Glayout.\u001b[66GIt\u001b[69Gcounts\u001b[76Gas\u001b[79Gdone\u001b[84Gwhen:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5Gthe\u001b[9Greference\u001b[19Gframes\u001b[26Gare\u001b[30Gunchanged;\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Ba test program with more than 8 slots\u001b[43Gd\u001b[46Gws;\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5Gt\u001b[7Gxture reloads \u001b[22Gun clean\u001b[31Gunder\u001b[37Gsynchronisation validation;\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Ba device without descriptor indexing is\u001b[45Grefused with its reason.\u001b[70G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThr\u001b[7Ge \u001b[10Ghoices were mine, so\u001b[31Gcheck them: \u001b[44G  \u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
