[0.101, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe 1 to 2 week effort is my estimate.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing is committed yet; this is docs only. I didn't\u001b[57Gr\u001b[59Gcord\u001b[64Ga matching \u001b[76Gntr\u001b[81Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/decisions.md\u001b[39m, since you haven't\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsettled the design\u001b[22Gy\u001b[24Gt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 1m 22s · done 5:21 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcommit it, but first do some research on which series of cards will support it\u001b[39m                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWeb Search\u001b[22m(\"Vulkan 1.3 required features\u001b[44GdescriptorIndexing\u001b[63Gmandatory\u001b[73GshaderSampledImageArrayNonUniformIndexing\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1BdescriptorBindingPartiallyBound\")\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mDid 1 search in 6s\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWeb Search\u001b[22m(\"VK_EXT_descriptor_in\u001b[36Gexing support GPU generat\u001b[62Gons NVIDIA\u001b[73GKepler\u001b[80GMaxwell\u001b[88GAMD\u001b[92GGCN\u001b[96GIntel\u001b[102Ggpuinfo\r\u001b[1B            descriptorBindingSampledImageUpdateAfterBind\")\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mDid 1 search in 6s\u001b[K\r\u001b[17C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m13\u001b[21G · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m621 tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[7B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
