[0.107, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAMD on Windows:\u001b[21G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[25GVulkan \"Roadmap 2022\" profile requires\u001b[64Gdescriptor\u001b[75Gindexing, and AMD says its\u001b[102Gdriver\u001b[109Gsupports\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  that profile on RX Vega and RDNA cards. I didn't check Polaris (RX 400/500) or older.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNVIDIA's own driver:\u001b[26G\u001b[22mI\u001b[28Gcouldn't\u001b[37Gcheck\u001b[43Git.\u001b[47GThere's\u001b[55Gno\u001b[58Gsource\u001b[65Gto\u001b[68Gread,\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Ggpuinfo's\u001b[88Gdevice\u001b[95Gdata\u001b[100Gwas\u001b[104Grefused\u001b[112Gwhen\u001b[117GI\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  tried to query it. Running \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvulkaninfo\u001b[43G\u001b[39mon\u001b[46Gan\u001b[49Golder\u001b[55Gcard\u001b[60Gwould\u001b[66Gsettle\u001b[73Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThese findings\u001b[18Gare written into the plan's facts se\u001b[55Gtion\u001b[60G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/dense-geometry-and-ray-tracing.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[101G\"Devices\"),\u001b[113Gand\u001b[117GJ68\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blinks to them. I skipped\u001b[28Gthe gate\u001b[37Gbecause the commit changes only docs.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 2m 9s · done 5:25 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mpush it, those are acceptable limits\u001b[39m                                                                                  \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mPush\u001b[10Gt\u001b[12G \u001b[1mfeature-base\u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m I pushed \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m28650ef\u001b[39m to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249morigin/feature-base\u001b[39m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m0d8953a..28650ef\u001b[39m).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GThe commit doesn't add a\u001b[28G\u001b