[0.112, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(docs/decisions.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 341 \u001b[14G\u001b[22mauthoring\u001b[24Grules\u001b[30Gare\u001b[34GManifest's\u001b[45G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mart standards\u001b[39m](../../manifest/docs/art-standards.md);\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gengine\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 342 \u001b[22m   supports the workflow and its test content follows them. [Roadmap J64 to\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 343 \u001b[14G\u001b[22mJ67](roadmap.md#a-separate-track-the-art-standards-support)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 344 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **Bindless textures, with descriptor indexing required** (2026-11-27, the user's). Every material   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 345 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  texture is in one descriptor array, indexed by slot from the material buffer, so a program's slot   \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G \u001b[5G \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 346 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  count is not the descriptor layout's. Device choice refuses a device without descriptor indexing:   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 347 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  of those today's 1.3 check accepts, that leaves out Intel's Broadwell on `hasvk`, and NVIDIA's own  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 348 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  driver is unchecked ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdevices\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](dense-geometry-and-ray-tracing.md#devices)); those limits are        \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 349 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  accepted. Raising the fixed slot count to sixteen, past the per-stage sampler minimum, was          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 350 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  rejected. [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mRoadmap J68\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](roadmap.md#j68)                                                             \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 351 \u001b[22m - **Clustered forward\u001b[34Grendering**\u001b[46G(2026-11-10).\u001b[60GLights\u001b[67Gare\u001b[71Gassigned\u001b[80Gto\u001b[83Gview-space\u001b[94Gclusters\u001b[103Gin\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 352 \u001b[14G\u001b[22mcompute,\u001b[23Gand\u001b[27Gevery\u001b[33Gsurface\u001b[41Gis\u001b[44Gshaded\u001b[51Gonce\u001b[56Gin\u001b[59Gits\u001b[63Gown\u001b[67Gmaterial\u001b[76Gprogram.\u001b[85GThere\u001b[91Gis\u001b[94Gno\u001b[97GG-buffer:\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 353 \u001b[22m   ambient occlusion reads the depth prepass's depth and normals instead. [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mRendering\u001b[39m](rendering.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BMaking \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratc\u001b[19Gpad\u001b[23Gedit\u001b[28G\u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+6\u001b[39m,\u001b[32Gcommitted\u001b[42G\u001b[1m7bc61d9\u001b[22m,\u001b[51Gpushed\u001b[58Gto\u001b[61G\u001b[1mfeature-base\u001b[22m,\u001b[75Grunning\u001b[83G\u001b[1m1\u001b[85G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[91Gcommand…\r\u001b[15C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[12C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m22s\u001b[17G· ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m896 tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
