[0.092, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242monsumers. Extraction beyond [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL06\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](#l06)'s concessions, with reserves apart from rates; surface and orb\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mital transport jobs between an operation, a station's warehouse and local delivery; and warehouse hand\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mling charges at load-out and receipt. Every leg checks capacity, time and ownership and saves its prog\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mress; no leg makes or duplicates goods. **Done when** extracted goods reach a consumer through every l\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242meg, each charge paid once to its operator, and the chain survives a save. | [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL06\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](#l06) for the extrac\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mtion rules. Settle the transport jobs' capacity, timing and cost, and each handling charge's rate, bas\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mis and payer. | [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mEconomy plan\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](economy-and-development-plan.md#the-physical-chain-no-task-yet) |      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 100 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m| 48 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"l50\"\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m></a>L50 | Recipe production: an unlocked [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mrecipe\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](glossary.md#recipe) worked by an \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242memployer's batches from fresh inputs at an operational workshop, where today's batches make goods from\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m nothing; and a batch cancelled, paying the wages earned so far and releasing the rest. **Done when** \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242ma region that has unlocked `RecipeBronze` turns copper and tin into bronze, a batch with missing input\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242ms does not start, and a cancelled batch pays and releases as selected. | Settle who owns a batch's inp\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242muts and outputs, batch timing and interruption, and the Bronze recipe's wage bill. | [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mEconomy plan\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](ec\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242monomy-and-development-plan.md#recipe-production-no-task-yet) |                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 101 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m| 49 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"l51\"\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m></a>L51 | Price inflation: the hosted multipliers reach about 27 times an item's ba\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mse price, so `IsValidBasePrice`'s room was raised from 10 to 30 times on 2026-11-25. Find what drives \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242ma price that high (the native curve, scarcity, the local bias, or a fault), and whether 30 stays. **Do\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mne when** the cause is named, the bound is set to what the multipliers can reach, and a test pins the \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mhighest. | — | [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mPrices\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](pricing.md#limits-and-open-work) |                                            \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1m 48s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m9.2k \u001b[32Gok\u001b[35Gns)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
