[0.170, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Message queued for delivery to ac1d470da4079111b at its next tool round. Sending this moved nothing it is \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mrunning to the\u001b[21Gbackground just now, so the message waits for that round unless something moves sooner. If it \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mfinishes\u001b[15Gfirs\u001b[20G, it is resumed with the message and notifies again, so wait for that notification before \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bresending.\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Message queued for delivery to a006364b5939cc9f5 at its next tool round. Sending this moved nothing it is \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Brunning to the background just now, so the message waits for that round unless something moves sooner. If it \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mfinishes first, it is resumed with the message and notifies again, so wait for that notification before \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mr\u001b[9Gending.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI've saved the new workflow as a memory and told both implementers there's no full gate in the lanes. My J63\u001b[112Gbuild\u001b[118Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bqueued behind\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gheavy\u001b[27Glock\u001b[32Gthat\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41GL15a\u001b[46Ggate\u001b[51Gholds,\u001b[58Gand\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Gcurrent\u001b[74Gbatch\u001b[80Gis\u001b[83GJ63,\u001b[88GJ36,\u001b[93GL15a\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102GW22b.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning cd '/home/ivan/projects/jettison.lane-b/' && scri…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/project\u001b[31G/j\u001b[34Gttison.lane-b/' &&\u001b[53Gscripts/heavy.sh cmake\u001b[76G--build --preset clang-debug --target \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bj\u001b[8Gttiso\u001b[14G_host_tests 2>&1 | grep -E \"error|warning:\