[0.025, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mClang-tidy only needs to be run with the full gate, it often is just correctly small style issues. The same with the \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwhitespace linefeed script. A good working build of the software and local check that it is complete and working is \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255menough to considered ready to merge. We will deal with issues at merge time as a batch.\u001b[39m                               \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command, recalled \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m memory, wrote \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m memories \u001b[74G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Message queued for delivery to ac1d470da4079111b at its next tool round. Sending this moved nothing it is \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mrunning to the background just now, so the message waits for that round unless something moves sooner. If it \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mfinishes first, it is resumed with the message and notifies again, so wait for that notification before \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mresending.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Message queued for delivery to a006364b5939cc9f5 at its next tool round. Sending this moved nothing it is \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mrunning to the background just now, so the message waits for that round unless something moves sooner. If it \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mfinishes first, it is re\u001b[31Gum\u001b[34Gd with the message\u001b[53Gand notifies again, so\u001b[76Gwait for that notification before \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mr\u001b[8Gsendi\u001b[14Gg.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[41C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· 23m 27s\u001b[52G· ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m5\u001b[58G.1k\u001b[62Gtokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[20C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;0;204;204m5\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[20;3H\u001b[?25h"]
