[0.080, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[2m281 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mA machi\u001b[20Ge without\u001b[30G`addr2line`,\u001b[43Gsuch\u001b[48Gas\u001b[51Ga\u001b[53Gplayer's,\u001b[63Gwrites\u001b[70Gonly\u001b[75Gmodules\u001b[83Gand\u001b[87Goffsets,\u001b[96Gwhich\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 282 \u001b[22m `scripts/symbolise-crash.sh <report> [build directory]` names later against the build that wrote\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m283 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthe report. U\u001b[27Ger the\u001b[34Gad\u001b[37Gress sanitiser\u001b[52Gnothing\u001b[60Gis\u001b[63Ginstalled\u001b[73Gand\u001b[77G`InstallCrashHandler`\u001b[99Greturns\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m283 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthe report, finding each module's debug file by the GNU build ID the report lists for it              \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m284 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`<directory>/.build-id/<2 digits>/<rest>.debug`, the layout a stripped release's kept debug files    \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m285 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mhave), els\u001b[23G by \u001b[28Gts name. Every binary the engine links\u001b[67Gcarries\u001b[75Ga\u001b[77GSHA-1\u001b[83Gbuild\u001b[89GID\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m286 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`--build-id=sha1`). The handler runs on a stack of its own on the thread that installs it and on     \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m287 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242meach\u001b[17Gthread holding a `Platform::ThreadCrashStack`, as the I/O worker and the scripts' watchdog do,   \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m288 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mso\u001b[15Gany\u001b[19Gof\u001b[22Gthose overflowing its stack is reported. Under the address sanitiser nothing is installed an\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m  \u001b[10G +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242md\u001b[14G`InstallCrashHandler` returns                                                                       \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m2\u001b[9G9 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mfalse,\u001b[19Gsince\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gsanitiser's\u001b[41Greport\u001b[48Gnames\u001b[54Gmore.\u001b[60GTracy's\u001b[68Gcrash\u001b[74Ghandler\u001b[82Gis\u001b[85Gcompiled\u001b[94Gout\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m2\u001b[9G0 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m(`TRACY_NO_CRASH_HANDLER`), so\u001b[43Gthere\u001b[49Gis\u001b[52Gonly\u001b[57Gone.\u001b[62GThe\u001b[66Gconsole's\u001b[76G`crash\u001b[83Gfault\u001b[89G|\u001b[91Gassert\u001b[98G|\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m291 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mexception` co\u001b[26Gmand cr\u001b[34Gshes the shell each way, to\u001b[62Gsee\u001b[66Ga\u001b[68Greport.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BRead\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m~/projects/jetti\u001b[23Gon.lane-b/docs/roadmap.md\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[13C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m28m 9s ·\u001b[23G↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m77.1k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[20C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;0;204;204m2\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
