[0.074, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 33 \u001b[22m | 2026-11-27 | The server's pack, client-side mods and the content check, J63: `side: client` packages\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m a server leaves out, `Host::WriteServerPack` (the packer's `--server`) for a dedicated server's bundle,\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22m and `Host::WorldContent`, whi\u001b[42Gh a client ch\u001b[56Gcks ag\u001b[63Gins\u001b[67G its server's, naming the package that differ\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mfiles, packs and mods\u001b[39m](files-and-mods.md#the-s\u001b[60Grvers-world\u001b[72Gcontent)\u001b[82G|\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m34\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2026-11-27 | A durable write th\u001b[45Gt refuses to repl\u001b[63Gce a\u001b[68Gfile, J32: `WriteNewFil\u001b[92GDurably`\u001b[101Gdecides it in\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B the rename itself (`renameat2`, `RENAME_NOREPLACE`) and throws `FileExistsError`\u001b[93Gnaming\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gpath\u001b[109G([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mper\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;230;219;116msistence\u001b[39m](persistence.md#a-write-that-refu\u001b[54Ges-to-replace)) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m35\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2026-11-27 | A lock's holder named, J34: `FileLock` wri\u001b[69Ges its process ID and program nam\u001b[104Gin\u001b[107Go\u001b[109Gits f\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bile, and `FileLock::Hol\u001b[35GerOf` r\u001b[43Gads \u001b[48Ghem for a refused caller's\u001b[75Gmessage\u001b[83G([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mpersistence\u001b[39m](persistence.md#a\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22m-locks\u001b[18Gholder)) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+10\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1m2372bd0\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\