[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22ma\u001b[13Gserver leaves out, `Host::WriteServ\u001b[49GrPack` (the p\u001b[63Gcker's\u001b[70G`--s\u001b[75Grver`) for a dedicated server's bundle,\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B and `Host::WorldContent`, which a client checks ag\u001b[63Ginst its server's,\u001b[82Gnaming the packag\u001b[100G that differs\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mfiles, packs and mods\u001b[39m](files-and-mods.md#the-\u001b[59Gervers-world-cont\u001b[77Gnt))\u001b[82G|\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m34\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2026-11-27 | A durable write that refuses to r\u001b[60Gplace a file, J32: `WriteNewFileDurably`\u001b[101Gdecides\u001b[109Git\u001b[112Gin\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22m the rename itself (`renamea\u001b[40G2`, `RENAME_NOREPLACE`) and\u001b[68Gthrows `FileEx\u001b[83GstsError` naming th\u001b[103G path\u001b[109G([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mper\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bsistence\u001b[39m](persistence.md#a-write-that-refuses-to-repl\u001b[65Gce)) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m35\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2026-11-27 | A lo\u001b[31Gk's holder named, J34: `FileLock` writes\u001b[72Gits\u001b[76Gprocess\u001b[84GID\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Gprogram\u001b[99Gname\u001b[104Ginto\u001b[109Gits\u001b[113Gf\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mile, and `FileLock::HolderOf` re\u001b[44Gds them for a refused caller's message ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mpersistence\u001b[39m](persistence.md#a\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B-\u001b[13Gocks-holder)) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+10\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1m2372bd0\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mCommitted.\u001b[14GMerging\u001b[22GJ11,\u001b[27Gthen\u001b[32Grebasing\u001b[41GJ36\u001b[45Go