builds\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m72\u001b[12G\u001b[22mag\u001b[15Ginst \u001b[21Ghe engine's\u001b[33Gpin, or agai\u001b[46Gst the engine lan\u001b[64G of its l\u001b[74Gtter with\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mBash\u001b[22m(sed -i 's/| A task, written, gated and reviewed there |/| A task, written and checked there, gated with its\u001b[116Gbatch\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B |/' docs/build-and-gates.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mUpdated \u001b[1mdocs/build-and-gates.md\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+2\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;179;89;107m-2\u001b[39m    \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[20;3H\u001b[?25h"]
