[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[14C\u001b[11B ☒ TUI text \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Engine text \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mManif\u001b[9Gst \u001b[13Gow\u001b[16Gships French\u001b[29Ga\u001b[31Gd Japanese\u001b[42Gcopies of the\u001b[56Gengine'\u001b[64G own text (the saves scr\u001b[89Gen, numbers,\u001b[102Gr\u001b[104Gasons), since \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mJettison has only English and German. Where should those live?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mMove them into Jettison (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe engine ships en, de, fr and ja for its own text, so every game gets them; Manifest drops its copies.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mKeep them in Manifest\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA game supplies whatever languages it wants of the engine's text.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3. Type something.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m4.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[17;1H"]
