[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;107;128m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest.lane-c/build/lane.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[38;2;255;107;128mError: File has been modified since read, either by the user or by a linter. Read it again before attempting to \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;255;107;128mwrite it.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mL43 is merged.\u001b[18GIt\u001b[21Graised\u001b[28Gthree\u001b[34Gdecisions,\u001b[45Gand\u001b[49Gthe\u001b[53Gfirst\u001b[59Gblocks\u001b[66GJapanese\u001b[75Gfrom\u001b[80Gdrawing\u001b[88Gat\u001b[91Gall:\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mWork\u001b[8Gng\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · 1m 37s\u001b[39m…\u001b[21G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m←  ☒ CJK font  ☒ TUI text  ☒ Engine text \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ✔ Submit \u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m →\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mReview your answers\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m ● The engine's UI fonts have no Japanese characters, so the Japanese\u001b[73Gtable\u001b[79Gdraws\u001b[85Gas\u001b[88Gboxes.\u001b[95GHow\u001b[99Gshould\u001b[106GJapanese\u001b[115Gtext\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[6G\u001b[22mget\u001b[10Ga\u001b[12Gfont?\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G \u001b[38;2;78;186;101m→ Game-supplied fallback fonts (Recommended)\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[4G\u001b[22m●\u001b[6GThe terminal UI's text is English from the console's commands, not in the string tables. Should it be translated\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[6Gtoo?\u001b[11G\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m→ Stay English (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001