[0.107, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[38;2;255;107;128mError: File has been modified since read, either by the user or by a linter. Read it again before attempting to \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bwrite it.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m L43 is merged. It raised three decisions, and the first blocks Japanese from drawing at all:\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · The engine's UI fonts have no Japanese characters, so the Japanese table draws as boxes. How should Japanese text\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bget a font? → Game-supplied fallback fonts (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· The terminal UI's text is English from the console's commands, not in the string tables. Should it be translated \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mtoo? → Stay English (Recomm\u001b[34Gnded)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Mani\u001b[13Ges\u001b[16G now ship\u001b[26G French\u001b[34Gand J\u001b[40Gpanese copi\u001b[52Gs of th\u001b[60G engine's own text (the saves screen, numbers, reasons), \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bsinc\u001b[12GJ\u001b[14Gtt\u001b[17Gson\u001b[21Ghas only English and\u001b[42GGer\u001b[46Gan. Where should those live?\u001b[75G→ Mov\u001b[82Gthem in\u001b[90Go J\u001b[94Gttison (Recomm\u001b[109Gnded)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAll three answers match my recommendations, so I'm setting up two new Jettison pieces: fallback fonts for Lane B and\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe engine's own French and Japanese text for Lane C.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[41C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mought for 7s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
