[0.825, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[12BRough\u001b[11Gexpectations,\u001b[25Gfrom\u001b[30Gtypical\u001b[38Gresults\u001b[46Grather\u001b[53Gthan\u001b[58Ganything\u001b[67Gmeasured\u001b[76Ghere:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mTurning off module scanning\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCMAKE_CXX_SCAN_FOR_MODULES OFF\u001b[39m): the cheapest\u001b[82Gwin,\u001b[87Gabout\u001b[93Gone\u001b[97Gline\u001b[102Gof\u001b[105GCMake.\u001b[112GPerhaps\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7G5–15% off a cold build and some off incremental ones.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7G\u001b[1mmold or lld instead of GNU ld:\u001b[22m linking is of\u001b[52Gen\u001b[55G3–10×\u001b[61Gfaster,\u001b[69Gespecially\u001b[80Gfor\u001b[84Glarge\u001b[90GDebug\u001b[96Gand\u001b[100GASan\u001b[105Gbinaries\u001b[114Gwith\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gdebug info. There are many test executables, so\u001b[55Gincremental rebuilds might be 10–30% faster.\u001b[100G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7G\u001b[1mPrecompiled headers\u001b[22m for the heavy headers (entt, glm, Jolt,\u001b[67GRmlU\u001b[72G, Vulkan,\u001b[82G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<format>\u001b[39m): of\u001b[97Gn 20–40%\u001b[106Goff\u001b[110Gcold\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gbuilds. It needs care wi\u001b[33G ccache\u001b[41G(its \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mpch_external_checksum\u001b[39m and sloppiness settings), cla\u001b[98Gg-tidy and clangd,\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Band helps warm in\u001b[25Gremental\u001b[34Gbuilds\u001b[41Gles\u001b[45G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7G\u001b[1mMoving to C++20 modules:\u001b[22m a\u001b[34Glarge refactor\u001b[49Gwhose\u001b[55Gtooling\u001b[63G(clang-tidy,\u001b[76Gclangd,\u001b[84Gccache)\u001b[92Gis\u001b[95Gstill\u001b[101Guneven.\u001b[109GI\u001b[111Gwouldn't\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gdo it now.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow much the gate gains:\u001b[30G\u001b[22ma\u001b[32Gwarm\u001b[37Ggate\u001b[42Gtakes\u001b[48G3–4\u001b[52Gminutes,\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gabout\u001b[71Gtwo\u001b[75Gthirds\u001b[82Gof\u001b[85Gthat\u001b[90Gis\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Glavapipe\u001b[106Gsmoke\u001b[112Gtests\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band reference frames, which none of thes\u001b[46G speed up. They mainly help cold builds, fresh\u001b[93Glanes (18 minutes cold) \u001b[27;1H"]
